  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    character: {fileID: -3929998360153519, guid: 7768e6cd5d1d84ba3b1a2c94654bef5d, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: 3825917228853779581, guid: 715adfd12147dc1479155bff01c07e0a, type: 3}
    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - They... do. However, there does not appear to be a translation. It <i>is</i>
      possible that something here corresponds to a method of decoding...
    - But it certainly is not something I can decipher on my own.
    - <SFX_liezel_concerned>Ha, it is possible Lorena even helped him come up with
      this. Still, that leaves us right back where we were.
